@EatoholicsbyShraddhaMehta Rating - 5 Star 🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟

@EatoholicsbyShraddhaMehta Review - Best Malvani Cuisine and great service. A must must visit. Price is just too good to be true.

So we tried Crab Thali and Prawns Thali. Both were amazing.

The Prawns Thali comes with Prawns Starter and it is just out of this world. They serve Bhakri, Puri and Roti as an option with Rice, Prawns Gravy, Sol Kadi and Chutney. The whole thalu was just too amazing.

The Crab Thali comes with big almost full size Crab 🦀 with lots of gravy (No seperate gravy for rice) but the crab as just too tasty.

It's an amazing place to visit if your wish to try Malvani Cusine..
